### SCENARIO: Create a request, then reject it
### Prerequisites: run 01-seed-balances.http first

### Step 1: Create a request
# @name createRequest
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "SICK",
  "startDate": "2026-06-01",
  "endDate": "2026-06-03",
  "days": 2,
  "reason": "Feeling unwell",
  "idempotencyKey": "reject-001"
}

### Step 2: Reject it
# Expected: 200 REJECTED, pending hold released
PATCH http://localhost:3000/requests/{{createRequest.id}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewerNote": "Team is short-staffed that week"
}

### Step 3: Verify balance — pending should be back to 0
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-1/loc-nyc
